{
  "id": "escaping",
  "name": "Dialogue: Escaping",
  "bg": "radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, #1c3a63, #0d2238 65%, #071220)",
  "particle": "dusk",
  "svg": "Act1_01_A_small_town_by_the_sea",
  "audio": "assets/music/Act1_Salt_on_the_Tracks.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fx": "fade",
      "align": "left",
      "svg": "Act1_01_A_small_town_by_the_sea",
      "id": "escaping_0",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "escaping_0_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Long ago, in a small town by the sea, there lived a man named Jonah.",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "left",
          "position": "middle-left",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "god",
      "fx": "bounce",
      "align": "right",
      "svg": "Act1_02_The_Call_to_Nineveh",
      "id": "escaping_1",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "escaping_1_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Jonah! Go to the great city of Nineveh. Tell them I see how they treat each other, and it must change.",
          "speaker": "god",
          "align": "right",
          "position": "middle-right",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "bounce",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "jonah",
      "fx": "type",
      "align": "left",
      "svg": "Act1_03_Nineveh",
      "id": "escaping_2",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "escaping_2_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Nineveh?! Those people are loud, and rude, and NOT my problem.",
          "speaker": "jonah",
          "align": "left",
          "position": "middle-left",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "type",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "jonah",
      "fx": "wave",
      "svg": "Act1_04_Nope_Going_the_other_way",
      "id": "escaping_3",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "escaping_3_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Nope. Nope nope nope. I am going the other way. As far as boats can go.",
          "speaker": "jonah",
          "align": "center",
          "position": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "wave",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fx": "fade",
      "align": "center",
      "svg": "Act1_05_The_Docks_at_Joppa",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Buy a ticket super fast",
          "note": "Jonah buys the very first ticket he sees. The ship is still headed to Tarshish."
        },
        {
          "label": "Hide behind a crate first",
          "note": "Jonah peeks around a crate... then buys a ticket anyway. Tarshish it is."
        }
      ],
      "id": "escaping_4",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "escaping_4_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "So Jonah packed a bag, ran to the docks at Joppa, and looked for a ship.",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "center",
          "position": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "audioSfx": "../shared/audio/jonah/sfx/sea_waves.mp3",
      "fx": "type",
      "svg": "Act1_05_Found_a_ship_to_Tarshish",
      "id": "escaping_5",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "escaping_5_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "He found a ship sailing to Tarshish — which was in the exact opposite direction of Nineveh.",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "center",
          "position": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "type",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "jonah",
      "fx": "fade",
      "svg": "Act1_07_Sail_away_fast_enough",
      "id": "escaping_6",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "escaping_6_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Perfect. If I just sail away fast enough, maybe I can outrun a job I don't want to do.",
          "speaker": "jonah",
          "align": "center",
          "position": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fx": "fade",
      "svg": "Act1_08_Fast_asleep_below_deck",
      "id": "escaping_7",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "escaping_7_text",
          "type": "text",
          "sfx": false,
          "text": "Jonah climbed aboard, went below deck, curled up... and fell fast asleep.",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "align": "center",
          "position": "center",
          "width": "1/2",
          "style": "comic",
          "entryFx": "fade",
          "delay": 800
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
